OL,3,GNEWSARail line shut for safety
OL,4,Ainspection after derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn East Sussex railway line, where a
OL,7,Fmajor train derailment recently took
OL,8,Fplace, has been closed for a
OL,9,Fprecautionary safety inspection.
OL,11,FNational Rail said the track between
OL,12,FHaywards Heath and Lewes was being
OL,13,Finspected just after 12:30 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe southbound line towards Lewes was
OL,17,Fblocked. However, Southern Rail said on
OL,18,FSaturday afternoon it had been
OL,19,Freopened.
OL,21,FThe northbound line remained open
OL,22,Fthroughout this time, it added.
